    <item>
      <title>Apple Silicon：从硬件统一到本地AI集群的“无心插柳”式变革</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/apple-siliconai-20251208194006144-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 19:40:06 +0800</pubDate>
